{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLIMB!</h2></h2>At the very beginning, you are an unknown, weak&amp;poor vagabond on a mission to raid some bizarre towers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/ac0ec2aa66f54163a1f56a39f4b74a7e.poster.avif?t=1695365725\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/ac0ec2aa66f54163a1f56a39f4b74a7e.webm?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/ac0ec2aa66f54163a1f56a39f4b74a7e.mp4?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT!</strong></h2>Houston... we've had a problem here :) There are residents - dangerous, but fascinating monsters! The game's combat system is a fast-paced combination of Hack'n'Slash, JRPG, and HoMM mechanics. <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/8c46bbc5b3a31aa43bce7933a01cbdac.poster.avif?t=1695365725\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/8c46bbc5b3a31aa43bce7933a01cbdac.webm?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/8c46bbc5b3a31aa43bce7933a01cbdac.mp4?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you ascend higher and higher... plundering the towers one by one... you will encounter more formidable and more cunning creatures. <br>Each new creature challenges your way of managing the battle.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAKE REWARD!</strong></h2>Defeated monsters hide in the shadows... here are all the benefits - gold, experience, LOOT!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/6580e4ecd031285e212dd0edf331c1c6.poster.avif?t=1695365725\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/6580e4ecd031285e212dd0edf331c1c6.webm?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/6580e4ecd031285e212dd0edf331c1c6.mp4?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET  STRONGER!</strong></h2>Level up. Improve attributes. Upgrade skills. Customize inventory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/bbe11a98b23eb0a5d789f0e7407a0431.poster.avif?t=1695365725\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/bbe11a98b23eb0a5d789f0e7407a0431.webm?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/bbe11a98b23eb0a5d789f0e7407a0431.mp4?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/79cbe302d24a7d5d230dcf28b588922e.poster.avif?t=1695365725\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/79cbe302d24a7d5d230dcf28b588922e.webm?t=1695365725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316690/extras/79cbe302d24a7d5d230dcf28b588922e.mp4?t=1695365725\" ty